{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ公演が終わるまでは\nレポは書けないので\n所感とかもろもろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、\n来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/14/1984718/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやー\n汗だくでした＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西武ドームで疲れなかったくらい\n体力には自信ある中田ですら\n結構疲れました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/14/1984718/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも最後まで全力でできたよ、たぶん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/14/1984718/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏に最後まで\n疲れてるように見えなかったって言われたもん！` ･ω･ ´w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そうなんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏、飛鳥、伊織が今日のアンダーライブ\n見に来てくれてたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/14/1984718/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね\n今日、友達も来てくれてたよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構、会ってて\n3週間ぶりくらいだったんだけど\nライブ中、見つけてテンション上がった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/14/1984718/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったと言っていただけて嬉しかったな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/14/1984718/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、\n「久しぶりに花奈可愛いって本気で思った(笑)」だって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どういうことやねん\nまあ、良かった良かった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会や、ブログコメントとかによると\n今回は当たらなかった方も多くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"複数回来れる方も\n本当に少ないみたいだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも以上に\n1回1回の公演を大切にしなきゃいけないと\n思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からも頑張ります！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/14/1984718/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/14/1984718/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤンジャン撮影のときの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天\n『料理サークルin木更津』見てねー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の料理サークルだよん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/14/1984718/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}